{"name":"harvana-support","version":1,"vocab":["account","activity","address","ajo","app","arrived","arriving","as","blank","book","broken","button","buy","buyer","came","cannot","change","cheating","claim","clicked","code","coins","compromised","confirmed","contract","contribution","copy","crashed","crashing","create","dark","delivered","did","discover","dispute","does","drip","email","empty","error","escrow","expected","explain","find","flight","fraud","freeze","from","get","gold","group","hacked","harv","has","hash","have","history","home","join","keeps","kept","link","list","log","login","long","looks","make","marketplace","match","missing","mode","never","new","not","nothing","number","older","open","order","orders","osusu","otp","p2p","paid","past","pay","payment","payout","pending","phishing","phone","phrase","poem","price","qr","receive","receiving","recommend","recovery","recreate","release","restaurant","return","reward","rewards","rules","same","savings","screen","screenshot","see","sell","seller","send","sends","sent","setup","should","show","sign","slot","someone","stake","staking","start","stays","still","stole","stuck","support","take","theme","think","this","time","toggle","tomorrow","trade","trading","transaction","transactions","transfer","translate","unauthorized","unbond","wallet","want","was","weather","when","where","who","will","with","won","work","write","wrong"],"labels":[{"id":"account_create","category":"Account","person":false,"answer":"A wallet is created on this phone. The recovery phrase stays on the device. Harvanna staff will never ask for it, and support cannot recreate it if it is lost."},{"id":"account_login","category":"Account","person":false,"answer":"Sign-in is the phone or email already on the account. Support cannot bypass that check or hand the account to someone else."},{"id":"wallet_receive","category":"Wallet","person":false,"answer":"Open the asset and use Receive. Senders must use the address this wallet shows. A screenshot of someone else's address is not yours."},{"id":"transfer_status","category":"Transfers","person":false,"answer":"Submitted means the phone sent it. Confirmed means the node accepted it into a block. Pending is not the same as confirmed, and support cannot call a transfer successful without the node saying so."},{"id":"transfer_history","category":"Transfers","person":false,"answer":"Transaction history is on the asset and in the activity list. If a hash is missing there, the node has no such transfer on this account."},{"id":"p2p","category":"P2P","person":false,"answer":"A P2P order stays in escrow until the trade finishes. Support can read the order. Support cannot release or return the escrow from this chat. That stays a guardian action."},{"id":"escrow_dispute","category":"P2P","person":true,"answer":"I can gather this, not decide it. A payment picture is not proof of payment. Open a ticket with the order id and the desk will compare the order, the escrow, and the chain. I will not release the escrow."},{"id":"groups","category":"Groups","person":false,"answer":"Groups are opened from Discover or from an invite. Contributions and payouts are in HARV. A slot and a payout follow the group rules, not a promise in chat."},{"id":"staking","category":"Staking","person":false,"answer":"Staking rewards follow the lock and the published drip. Support can explain that record. It cannot invent a reward or pay one from this chat."},{"id":"security","category":"Security","person":true,"answer":"This needs a person. I cannot freeze an account, reverse a transfer, or release escrow. Use Report a security issue so the desk gets a case without those secrets."},{"id":"app","category":"App","person":false,"answer":"If a screen fails, force-close the app and open it again. Tell support the screen name and what you tapped. Do not send a seed phrase or a private key with the report."},{"id":"unknown","category":"Other","person":true,"answer":"I don't have an approved answer fo